 "purpose": "OWNERS-HBM/VM-GLUE 2026-10-18 (HBM d4g plan (b), top-down contract: glue goes into a hardened tile): VM hub glue tile for SE (R0, sid 1) / NE (MX, sid 3) (hb_vms_SE, hb_vms_NE) = ot_vms_hub_static + 2 ot_vms_rstop_static + ot_vms_rcl_static + ot_vms_status_static, the 8 banks hoisted to die-level instances (gen_vms_hoist.py / HBM-B-RTL1 qb glue, logic unchanged). Tile top hfd_hgi_vms_glue_e_t (gen_vms_glue_tiles.py): one clock (clk_hub/clk_ring/clk_replay are one stream clock), per-bank bank ports, sid strap pin (one master for SE and NE). Every port lands on / leaves from a flop except bank_status (status OR / CE adder rungs, as the slice) and the xq_done fault compare.",
